subtrack (subtrack v{VERSION})

Backup database (gzip compressed)

USAGE:
  subtrack backup <OPTIONS> [<destination>]

ARGUMENTS:
  destination           Backup destination directory (default: ~/.config/subtrack/backups/)

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help             Display this help message
  -v, --version          Display this version
  -e, --encrypt          Encrypt the backup with your database key

